  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Support to Reintegration of Returnees, IDPs and vulnerable Host Communities in Blue Nile State</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide emergency support to returnees and host communities in Blue Nile State. The project has three main components: ul  li Emergency food security support (agriculture and livestock) to returnees, IDPs and vulnerable host communities in Blue Nile State; LI Support of marginalized HHs through promoting and strengthening livelihoods coping mechanisms including IGAs in Blue Nile State; LI Mitigation of natural resources degradation in Blue Nile State.  /UL This project will be implemented in areas of high rural population concentration and areas of high population returns in the State.</narrative>
  </description>
